 ('silicon-publisher','The Silicon Man — reissue description','Charles Platt, publisher description reproduced by Google Books','https://books.google.com/books?id=yZPCzgEACAAJ','publisher_description','MAPHIS implements an uploaded environment for FBI investigator James Bayley.','Confirms active uploaded life, but not a continuing community’s productive and access institutions; an immortality promise is not an established general economy.'),
 ('silicon-review','Silicon Man','John Cartan, Wired','https://www.wired.com/1993/06/silicon-man/','secondary_review','Describes life within the system, administrator power and a system crash.','Short review of an experimental uploaded protagonist, not a verified supported society or population census.'),
